    <string name="a11y_disclosure_title">Copy detection</string>
    <string name="a11y_disclosure">Edge Clipboard uses the Android Accessibility Service API to detect when you tap \"Copy\" or when a \"Copied\" message shows in other apps. It then reads the clipboard once and saves the clip on this phone.\n\nThe service does not read screen content, does not record what you type, and sends no data off the phone. Clips stay in app storage and, if you choose one, in your selected folder.\n\nYou can turn this off at any time in Accessibility settings.</string>
