    <string name="autostart">Start after phone restart</string>
    <string name="autostart_desc">Shows the handle again after a restart or an app update. Your clips, settings and handle position are always saved.</string>
    <string name="autolaunch">Auto launch (only without Copy detection)</string>
    <string name="autolaunch_desc">With Copy detection on, Android starts the app after a restart by itself. Without it, ColorOS needs Auto launch: open App info, select Battery usage, then turn on \"Allow auto launch\" (on some versions: \"Allow background activity\").</string>
